# HPC-Only Execution Policy

- Never execute this repository's code, tests, training scripts, or workflows on the local PC.
- Assume the runnable environment exists only on HPC (dependencies, data paths, and scheduler setup are HPC-only).
- If execution is requested, provide HPC-ready commands/scripts instead of running locally.
- If a local run is attempted, stop and explain that execution must happen on HPC.

# Examples

```bash
